{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"X\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"S07-S09、S11中，未来遇到困难只能独自承担、是否需要有人陪伴的顾虑比较突出，短暂地把主线推向了对孤独和缺少支持的担忧。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"S03、S08-S12中，怀念旧日生活逐渐更多地收束为怀念有人陪伴、有人分担孤单；旧日生活本身的自在感和整体归属感相对弱化。\",\n    \"维持尊严的行动较多表现为不愿再受委屈、不愿回头，主动选择并坚持一种不再牺牲自己的生活方式这一面相对不够突出。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"X更完整地保留了旧日生活的美好、被当作自己人的归属感，以及不愿再忍受委屈的尊严诉求，并让三者在反复心动、抗拒、重新选择中相互牵动。Y则稍微偏向了“害怕孤单、想有人陪伴”与“不想再受委屈”之间的矛盾，因而把Center收窄成了一个更具体的顾虑。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fb0a4402-4a2f-4f72-ba0a-33b43009012f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T074623004617Z", "elapsed_seconds": 73.75, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T07:47:36.763310+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e08b1e8d4bc1d8c22b8ddc07f76aadd0a42cc1688d5330e5a7e494e7d215aaf7", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachment